      "message": "Add Ssube extension definition\n\nAdd YAML definition for the Ssube (Big-endian User Mode) extension.\n\nSsube indicates that the implementation supports big-endian user mode,\nmeaning sstatus.UBE can be set to 1. This requires U_MODE_ENDIANNESS\nto be either 'big' or 'dynamic'.\n\nCloses #1203",
